HST Office: Slides and Draw ribbon commands (Apply to All, Preview, timing, Rotate Page), first-start layout, themes.

- New sd slots, the commands the Slide Transition and Animation decks run as buttons, for the ribbon
  (hst-ribbon-ux-impress-draw.patch places them):
  .uno:HstApplyTransitionToAll (SID_HST_TRANSITION_APPLY_ALL): the current slide's transition, duration,
  advance and sound go to every slide as one undo action (SlideTransitionPane's "Apply Transition to All
  Slides"); .uno:HstPreviewTransition (SID_HST_TRANSITION_PREVIEW) plays the current slide's transition and
  .uno:HstPreviewAnimation (SID_HST_ANIMATION_PREVIEW) its animations (the decks' "Play", SlideShow::
  StartPreview). Disabled without a slide, for a read-only document (apply), with nothing to play or in
  LibreOfficeKit (preview). Normal view handles all three, the slide sorter the transition ones.
- Transition timing on the ribbon (tab Chuyển tiếp ▸ Thời gian), the deck's Duration and Advance Slide:
  .uno:HstSetTransitionDuration?Duration:long=<ms> (SID_HST_TRANSITION_DURATION) and
  .uno:HstSetTransitionAdvance?Advance:long=<ms> (SID_HST_TRANSITION_ADVANCE, -1: on mouse click) set the
  selected slides (the current slide in normal view) as one undo action each; their state is the current
  slide's value. Their toolbox items get HstTransitionDurationControl ("Thời lượng" spin field) and
  HstTransitionAdvanceControl ("Tự chuyển sau" check box and spin field), InterimItemWindow controls built
  as the transitions gallery is (sd/source/ui/controller/HstTransitionTimingControls.cxx,
  hsttransitionduration.ui, hsttransitionadvance.ui; Controller.xcu, sd.component, UIConfig_simpress.mk;
  Vietnamese in sd/messages.po).
  sd app.hrc, sdraw.sdi, drviewsh.sdi, SlideSorterController.sdi, drviews2.cxx, drviews7.cxx,
  SlideSorterViewShell.cxx, Library_sd.mk; new HstSlideEffectCommands.{hxx,cxx}; DrawImpressCommands.xcu
  labels and their Vietnamese in UI.po.
- HST Draw "Xoay trang" (ribbon Trang ▸ Xoay trang): .uno:HstRotatePageLeft / .uno:HstRotatePageRight
  (SID_HST_ROTATE_PAGE_LEFT/RIGHT) turn the selected pages of the page pane (the current page without one)
  by 90°: width and height and the margins swap, every object turns about the page (SdrObject::Rotate and
  Move) so the content keeps its place, as one undo action (SdrUndoGeoObj per object and
  SdPageFormatUndoAction per page); the view follows the new size as SwitchPage does for pages of different
  sizes. Disabled in HST Slides (slides share one size), in master and notes views and read-only documents.
  sd/source/ui/func/HstRotatePage.cxx, HstRotatePage.hxx; labels in DrawImpressCommands.xcu and UI.po.
- sfx2 SidebarController: the first time HST Slides shows its sidebar it is folded to the tab bar, so the
  slide gets the room; org.openoffice.Office.HSTRibbon/SlidesSidebarFirstStartDone makes it once only.
- officecfg ImpressWindowState.xcu: the Drawing toolbar (private:resource/toolbar/toolbar) is hidden by
  default in HST Slides; the ribbon's Trang đầu ▸ Bản vẽ and Chèn ▸ Minh họa hold the same tools. Choosing
  View ▸ User Interface ▸ Standard Toolbar still shows it (ToolbarMode.xcu lists it for that mode), and
  View ▸ Toolbars ▸ Drawing shows it again. HST Draw keeps its vertical drawing bar (PDF editing).
- svx themeselectorpanel.ui (Slides Design ▸ Chủ đề): the gallery was 65 px high and clipped its items; it
  is one row of previews (88 px, the ribbon body) with six columns of the preview's width.
- svx ThemeColorsPaneBase.cxx: with a Vietnamese interface the bundled themes are listed as Bãi biển,
  Gió nhẹ, Rừng xanh, Đại dương, Cầu vồng, Hoàng hôn; the theme files and the names saved in documents
  stay English, other themes keep their names.

Risk: nothing here is compiled or run yet (each C++ file passes a syntax-only compile against the build
tree); the .ui sizes need a check at 1485 and 1366 px; the first-start fold depends on the sidebar's first
context update coming after its window exists.

